/* MvHeroHeader — full-bleed cover photo + scrim + optional floating controls.
 * Spec: DESIGN_IMPLEMENTATION.md §6 row 8, §8.2 (240dp hero) and §8.3 (340dp hero).
 * Figma: `Hero Cover Container` 15:560 (340dp) / 9:110 (240dp),
 * `Back Icon Action` 31:2823, `Beach Selector` 30:2812, `Environmental Badges` 15:562.
 *
 * NOTE: no hex literals anywhere in this file, comments included —
 * TokenDisciplineTests.ComponentUss_HasNoHardcodedColors scans the raw text.
 *
 * GEOMETRY (1 USS px = 1 dp = 1 Figma pt, §1.2)
 *   hero      390x340 (default) / 390x240 (`--compact`), photo full-bleed
 *   scrim     primary at 0.35 (default) / 0.25 (`--compact`)
 *   controls  top row 32dp below the hero top, 16dp gutters
 *   back      40dp circle, surface fill, 1px outline-variant, 20dp glyph
 *   selector  42dp pill, surface fill, 1px outline-variant, 20dp pin + 16/600
 *             ls 0.1 name + 24dp chevron, 16dp inner gutters
 *   badges    pinned 23dp (21dp compact) above the hero bottom, 16dp gutters, gap 8
 *
 * THREE DELIBERATE DEVIATIONS FROM THE FIGMA COORDINATES
 *  1. V2 puts the back circle at x=25 and the pill at x=76..371, i.e. a 346dp group
 *     with 25/19 side margins that lines up with nothing. Here both hero gutters are
 *     16dp — the same gutter as the badge row above them (x=16 in Figma) and as the
 *     content body below — so the controls sit on the screen's grid. The pill's LEFT
 *     edge still lands at 76 exactly (16 gutter + 48 touch target + 12 gap); its
 *     right edge gains 3dp and the back circle moves 5dp left.
 *  2. The pill and the back button are interactive, so their ROOTS are ≥48dp touch
 *     targets with the 42dp / 40dp visuals centred inside (the MdChip / MdIconButton
 *     pattern). That lowers the visual top edge by 3dp against V2's y=32.
 *  3. V2's pill is a fixed 295dp; here it flexes into whatever the row leaves, so a
 *     360dp phone shrinks the pill instead of overflowing the screen.
 *
 * THE SCRIM IS A LAYER, NOT A TRANSLUCENT COLOR LITERAL
 *   `background-color: var(--md-sys-color-primary)` + `opacity` on a child that has
 *   nothing but background. Writing the translucency into the color itself is
 *   banned by TokenDisciplineTests (which scans comments too), and
 *   fading the ROOT would fade the photo and the controls with it.
 *
 * WHY THE BADGE ROW IS ABSOLUTELY POSITIONED
 *   It must hug the hero's bottom edge whether or not the top row exists. Flex
 *   `space-between` only does that with two children present, and UI Toolkit has no
 *   `margin: auto`. Absolute + `bottom` is unconditional and costs no extra element.
 */

.mv-hero-header {
    height: 340px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.mv-hero-header--compact {
    height: 240px;
}

.mv-hero-header__image {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
}

.mv-hero-header__scrim {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
    opacity: 0.35;
}

.mv-hero-header--compact .mv-hero-header__scrim {
    opacity: 0.25;
}

/* Controls plane. Separate from the photo so the host's status-bar inset
 * (MvHeroHeader.TopInset -> padding-top here) pushes the controls down without
 * moving the image. */
.mv-hero-header__foreground {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
}

/* ---- Top row: back button + selector pill ---- */

.mv-hero-header__top-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
}

/* MdIconButton restyled to V2's white floating circle. The 48dp root and the
 * 40dp container come from MdIconButton.uss; only the skin changes here.
 * ORDER-DEPENDENT: these rules tie with MdIconButton.uss's `--standard` rules on
 * specificity (both 0,2,0), so they win only because the theme files import
 * MdIconButton.uss BEFORE MvHeroHeader.uss. Keep that order in both .tss files. */
.mv-hero-header__back {
    margin-right: 12px;
}
.mv-hero-header__back .md-icon-button__container {
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-surface);
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: var(--md-sys-color-outline-variant);
    color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
}
.mv-hero-header__back .md-state-layer {
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
}
.mv-hero-header__back .md-icon {
    font-size: 20px;
}

/* Selector: root is the ≥48dp touch target, __selector-container the 42dp pill. */
.mv-hero-header__selector {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    min-height: 48px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: stretch;
}

.mv-hero-header__selector-container {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    height: 42px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-full);
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: var(--md-sys-color-outline-variant);
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-surface);
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
}

.mv-hero-header__selector .md-state-layer {
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
}

.mv-hero-header__selector-icon {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-right: 8px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* title-small metrics bumped to V2's 16px, 600 face, ls 0.1 (one of the three
 * strings in the whole design with non-zero tracking — see _typography.uss). */
.mv-hero-header__selector-label {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    -unity-font-definition: url("/Assets/DesignSystem/Fonts/Inter-SemiBold.asset");
}

.mv-hero-header__selector-chevron {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-left: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.mv-hero-header__selector:hover .md-state-layer {
    opacity: var(--md-sys-state-hover-opacity);
}
.mv-hero-header__selector:focus .md-state-layer {
    opacity: var(--md-sys-state-focus-opacity);
}
.mv-hero-header__selector:active .md-state-layer {
    opacity: var(--md-sys-state-pressed-opacity);
}

/* ---- Badge row ---- */

.mv-hero-header__badges {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 23px;
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    padding-left: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
}

.mv-hero-header--compact .mv-hero-header__badges {
    bottom: 21px;
}

.mv-hero-header__badge {
    margin-left: 8px;
}

.mv-hero-header__badge--first {
    margin-left: 0;
}
